  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AdSyksKV/images/d680017567dcce7d6f9be763945e0bc50fe0aa97.png\" alt=\"快捷栏\"></p>\n<h1>歡迎來到金胡蘿蔔幫！</h1>\n<p>這是一個非常簡單的資源包，將你的飢餓條變為金胡蘿蔔圖標，而不是肉。金胡蘿蔔貼圖忠於原版遊戲中的金胡蘿蔔貼圖。</h1>\n<h1>特色</h1>\n<ul>\n<li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AdSyksKV/images/34b0b477267122ba4493b3e8385319d095aaf353.png\" alt=\"黑胡蘿蔔\"> 包含負面狀態效果圖標。</li>\n<li>與 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fappleskin\" rel=\"nofollow\">AppleSkin</a> 兼容</li>\n<li>與 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffarmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a> 兼容</li>\n<li>酷炫 ✅</li>\n</ul>",
